                "svg": "<svg width=\"179\" height=\"53\"><text font-family=\"Consolas\" font-size=\"9.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">HOST-1\nIPv6: 2001:db8:10:3::2/64\nGateway: 2001:db8:10:3::1 </text></svg>",
                "x": -402,
                "y": 197,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "e69e678d-c2f8-4dfd-9f68-d679e18a9d20",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"179\" height=\"53\"><text font-family=\"Consolas\" font-size=\"9.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">HOST-2\nIPv6: 2001:db8:10:2::10/64\nGateway: 2001:db8:10:2::1 </text></svg>",
                "x": 492,
                "y": 10,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "38c666cb-addf-451e-8065-2568203eac4a",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"205\" height=\"143\"><text font-family=\"Consolas\" font-size=\"9.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">ISP-LAB \u2013 EXTERNAL TEST TARGET\neth0: 2001:db8:30:1::1/64\nLoopback: 2001:db8:ffff::1/128\n\nStatic return routes:\n2001:db8:10::/48 via R4\n2001:db8:20:1::/64 via R4\n\nOSPF: Not participating </text></svg>",
                "x": -418,
                "y": -252,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "5b8419c8-d067-4c42-bd4d-befc10dce2dc",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"284\" height=\"72\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0000be\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">SAVE (before closing, on R1, R2, R4)\nvtysh -c 'write memory'\ncp /etc/frr/frr.conf /root/frr.conf.bak\ncp /etc/frr/daemons  /root/daemons.bak </text></svg>",
                "x": -852,
                "y": -364,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "90f58ed9-a003-47d4-a50a-a08f4e9d5278",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"337\" height=\"232\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0000cb\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">RESTORE (after reopening)\n\n1. All nodes (R1, R2, R4, Host-1, Host-2, ISP-LAB):\n   /root/configure-ipv6.sh\n\n2. Routers only (R1, R2, R4):\n   cp /root/daemons.bak /etc/frr/daemons\n   cp /root/frr.conf.bak /etc/frr/frr.conf\n   chown frr:frr /etc/frr/daemons /etc/frr/frr.conf\n   /usr/lib/frr/frrinit.sh restart\n\n3. Wait ~40 s, then check on routers:\n   vtysh -c 'show ipv6 ospf6 neighbor'\n   -&gt; Full (DR/BDR after the slash is normal) </text></svg>",
                "x": -858,
                "y": -282,
                "z": 2
            }
        ],
